Package: fandyn
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: deniz <onurdenizakan@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.27), init-system-helpers (>= 1.18~)
Homepage: https://github.com/odakan/fandyn-driver
Description: calibrated low-noise fan control for Jetson Nano
 fandyn learns the board once, at install: it measures the fan, fits a
 physical thermal model, then designs and tests a fixed fan profile.
 .
 The runtime daemon is a tiny integer-only loop that follows that profile:
 silent when cool, full speed under heavy load, and full speed whenever it
 cannot read a sensor. It hands the fan back to the kernel when stopped.
